@url=http://localhost:3000

### Registrar usuario
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Benjamin Gramajo",
    "email": "benjamin@mail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Registro con email repetido 
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Benjamin Gramajo",
    "email": "benjamin@mail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Registro con email inválido 
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Benjamin Gramajo",
    "email": "esto-no-es-un-email",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Registro con contraseña muy corta 
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Benjamin Gramajo",
    "email": "otro@mail.com",
    "password": "123"
}

### Login correcto
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "benjamin@mail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta 
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "benjamin@mail.com",
    "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Login con email inexistente 
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "noexiste@mail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Login con datos inválidos 
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "no-es-email",
    "password": ""
}

### Ruta protegida sin token 
GET {{url}}/auth/perfil

### Ruta protegida con token (ejecutar primero el login correcto)
GET {{url}}/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
